{"title": "Unknown", "index": 3, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\" id=\"1T140-4effa038bcf548648d8f9b818a60b5e2\">\n<h1 class=\"bodycontent-first-title\" id=\"1T141-4effa038bcf548648d8f9b818a60b5e2\">内在体验</h1>\n<p class=\"bodycontent-text\">黑夜也是一个太阳。</p>\n<p class=\"bodycontent-text\">——扎拉图斯特拉<sup class=\"calibre3\"><a class=\"calibre2\" href=\"part0005.html#bz1\" id=\"bz1\">[1]</a></sup></p>\n</body>"}]}